@baseUrl = http://localhost:5070
@apiAccessToken = <API_ACCESS_TOKEN_FROM_MSAL>
@adoProjectId = <VISIBLE_AZURE_DEVOPS_PROJECT_GUID>
@workItemId = 1

### Connection test (requires an API bearer token acquired by the SPA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/azure-devops/status
Authorization: Bearer {{apiAccessToken}}

### Projects visible to the signed-in user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/azure-devops/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{apiAccessToken}}

### Work items in a visible project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/azure-devops/projects/{{adoProjectId}}/work-items?top=100
Authorization: Bearer {{apiAccessToken}}

### Work item details and existing local links
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/azure-devops/work-items/{{workItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiAccessToken}}
